  "hts_code": "9018.90.90",
  "reason": "Both the handheld control/display unit and the imager cable are component parts of a video inspection scope and are classified as parts and accessories of optical instruments, which fall under heading 9018 (instruments and apparatus for measuring, testing, navigating or detecting) and subheading 9018.90.90 for other such parts."
